<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The Google TV launcher banner: the mark plus the wordmark, at the 16:9 the launcher expects.

  A vector rather than the usual 320x180 xhdpi PNG, because the Streamer renders this row at whatever
  size the current launcher wants and a raster would soften. The wordmark is Outfit Bold converted to
  outlines - the launcher process cannot see this app's bundled font, so drawing it as text was never
  an option.

  Square corners on purpose: the launcher applies its own rounding, and baking one in shows up as a
  dark notch inside the system's.
-->
